id=statusbar_icon_order
name=Status Bar Icon Order (WiFi next to Signal)
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=AxLblahblah
description=Makes the status bar show Wi-Fi directly to the left of the mobile signal/data icon (the iOS / Android 16 arrangement) via a systemless framework overlay. Reboot to apply. Remove the module and reboot to fully revert. Requires Android 12+. Device tuned for Redmi A1+ / POCO C50 (snow / ice, Android 12 Go).
minMagisk=20400
